# Keep the build context small: the image builds from source inside the build stage, so the host's
# installed modules, build outputs, VCS and tooling state must never be copied in.
**/node_modules
.git
.github
.githooks
**/dist
**/coverage
.claude
test-results
playwright-report
e2e
*.log
.DS_Store
Dockerfile.relay
.dockerignore
